e who follow [their] passions want you to digress [into] a great deviation.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"4:28","t":"And Allāh wants to lighten for you [your difficulties]; and mankind was created weak.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"4:29","t":"O you who have believed, do not consume one another's wealth unjustly but only [in lawful] business by mutual consent. And do not kill yourselves [or one another]. Indeed, Allāh is to you ever Merciful.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"4:30","t":"And whoever does that in aggression and injustice - then We will drive him into a Fire. And that, for Allāh, is [always] easy.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"4:31","t":"If you avoid the major sins which you are forbidden, We will remove from you your lesser sins and admit you to a noble entrance [into Paradise].","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"4:32","t":"And do not wish for that by which Allāh has made some of you exceed others. For men is a share of what they have earned, and for women is a share of what they have earned. And ask Allāh of His bounty. Indeed Allāh is ever, of all things, Knowing.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"4:33","t":"And for all, We have made heirs to what is left by parents and relatives. And to those whom your oaths have bound [to you] - give them their share. Indeed Allāh is ever, over all things, a Witness.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":33,"sd":null}],"juz":5,"hizb":9,"surahs":[4],"sajdah":false}